  "changes": [
    "Private derivative manifest name/version/private flag and UPSTREAM.json file inclusion.",
    "New lib/guard.js: fixed internal100, parser SyntaxError/ERR_BRACES_DEPTH, threaded visited-container RangeError/ERR_BRACES_DEPTH, bounded parent prefix/cycle errors.",
