    "lib/compile.js, lib/expand.js and lib/stringify.js thread local child depth through the existing traversal, preserving original shortcuts/iterator consumption.",
    "Both private expand-to-stringify fallback calls propagate incoming ancestor depth and initial-root state; public Braces exports/options stay unchanged.",
    "Both lib/expand.js upward parent loops gain separate identity sets/counters without changing stop/queue logic."
